Loading with the current setup:

/user/dcobas/ertm14/py/bin/python3 \
/user/dcobas/ertm14/devel/wrpc-sw/tools/uart-bootloader/usb-bootloader.py \
   -b default -t -s 912600 -p /dev/ttyUSB2 \
    /user/dcobas/ertm14/devel/wrpc-sw/wrc.bin

Serial line connection using cu:

/user/dcobas/bin/cu -l ttyUSB2 -s 921600 -E ^C

(the escape Ctrl-C is good to avoid multi-escaping tilde characters,
used both by ssh and cu by default)
